{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four players enter a cursed place. Only those who solve its riddles will escape alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Red Riddles</i>, you and up to three friends step into haunted locations where every corner whispers danger. Blood-written riddles taunt you, monsters prowl the halls, and the clock ticks down toward your final breath. Survive long enough to uncover the demon\u2019s name, rescue teammates buried alive, and race back to the car before the curse claims you all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is unpredictable: riddles shift, scares strike at random, and monsters adapt to your fear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Horror Survival</strong> \u2013 Play solo or with up to 3 friends in tense, first-person horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Twisted Riddles</strong> \u2013 Decipher blood-smeared puzzles that reveal the demon\u2019s identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buried Alive</strong> \u2013 When monsters catch you, you\u2019re dragged into a grave. Teammates must dig you out before it\u2019s too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Monsters</strong> \u2013 Ghosts, demons, and worse stalk you based on sound, movement, and mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Scares</strong> \u2013 Randomized riddles, monster behavior, and jump scares keep each run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunted Map\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Explore eerie houses, a graveyard, and cursed grounds filled with hidden clues.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Game!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2784120/0f7f2315d5d7f162c816349866641d502e21b43b.jpg"},{"name":"Guessed a Riddle!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity